I'm sorry!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.470
I didn't listen to Davi!

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:13.380
It's Charll my fault!

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:16.050
It's not Charll your fault.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.260
It's mine, too.

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:22.620
After all, you turned into a human for my sake.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:26.330
So this time, I'll do my best to help you!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.300
