00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:36.990
Girls!

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:39.490
Sorry I'm late!

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:40.630
I'm sorry!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.330
Cure Heart!

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.000
