00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:45.850
Great, let's go!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.710
You girls shall aim at its front!

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.910
I shall aim at its back!

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.830
Gotcha!

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.280
