00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:11.310
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:22.900
Your heart shall go aflutter! {C}

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:24.580
Ace Shot!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.980
Bang!

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:37.310
Love love looooove!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:38.850
Love!

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:42.700
"Invincible" my gut!

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.310
