00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.070
Hmph!

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:52.780
Huh?

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:03.400
Everyone...

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:07.930
This was all my fault, so I'm sorry.

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:11.770
