00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:14.480
I know how you feel, Charles.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.730
You want to help the people you love.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:19.830
Same here.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:26.340
You know, I was so happy that you tried so hard to help me.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:30.040
Juujou even said we looked like sisters.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:34.240
I really think of you like a little sister, Charles.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:36.250
Because I love you!

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:38.270
Mana...

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:45.490
Um, excuse me...

00:20:48.530 --> 00:20:51.950
We owe our thanks to a student from this school.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:54.070
She helped me, too.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:59.040
I wanted to thank her again, but I didn't catch her name...

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:00.740
She was all "Charl", right?

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:02.940
Oh, that's her!

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:06.270
She kept saying "Charl"!

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:08.050
Do you know who that might be?

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.250
We do!

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:12.910
Her name is Charles, and she's splendid in many ways.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.610
She's a good friend of ours.

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:18.960
She's always helping us out, too.

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:22.330
