00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:13.010
Pretty please!

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:14.250
Wait, what?!

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:16.010
The fairy turned into a dragon!

00:22:16.010 --> 00:22:18.550
My, it's so massively cute.

00:22:18.550 --> 00:22:21.220
We can't keep it, Alice. It's impossible, you hear me?

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:22.990
We can have no complaints about our opponent.

00:22:22.990 --> 00:22:24.260
Let's go, girls!

00:22:24.260 --> 00:22:26.390
