00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:29.030
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:31.500
Final Ordeal!

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:31.500
Final Ordeal!

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:31.500
"Final Ordeal! The Legendary Precure!"

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:33.870
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
